1
00:00:00,523 --> 00:00:02,170
Now there are two bodies.

2
00:00:03,559 --> 00:00:06,531
One moving… one seen.

3
00:00:09,062 --> 00:00:10,553
Which one are you?

4
00:00:11,495 --> 00:00:13,171
Can you be in both?

5
00:00:14,551 --> 00:00:18,195
If you choose one… what
happens to the other?

6
00:00:19,898 --> 00:00:22,386
Is either one more 'you'…

7
00:00:22,699 --> 00:00:25,828
or are both simply appearances?

8
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,257
Look at your right arm.

9
00:00:30,576 --> 00:00:32,488
Please raise your right hand,

10
00:00:32,684 --> 00:00:34,960
and notice how your body moves.

11
00:00:36,142 --> 00:00:39,515
Please place your right
hand on your left shoulder.

12
00:00:44,009 --> 00:00:45,902
Please raise your left hand,

13
00:00:46,114 --> 00:00:48,680
and notice how your body moves.

14
00:00:49,738 --> 00:00:53,111
Please place your left
hand on your right shoulder.

15
00:00:57,671 --> 00:00:59,453
Which one is yours?

16
00:00:59,956 --> 00:01:01,633
Can you be in both?

17
00:01:02,923 --> 00:01:04,570
You don't need to answer.

18
00:01:05,119 --> 00:01:08,101
Just notice that awareness
can see two bodies

19
00:01:08,263 --> 00:01:11,276
without needing either
one to be a fixed self.

